// when its concrete type is one net/http can rewind (*bytes.Reader,
// *bytes.Buffer, *strings.Reader). An arbitrary stream such as an *os.File has
// no replayable body, so such a request fails on the first 429 instead of
// retrying. Use AddFile (which buffers into a *bytes.Reader) when you want
// uploads to participate in the retry policy.
